The '''Kelvin Ravine''' was a canyon located on the [[desert]] [[planet]] [[Jakku]] of the [[Western Reaches]].<ref name="TFAVD" /> It contained at least one settlement, [[Tuanul]], which was [[Attack on Tuanul|sacked]] in [[34 ABY]] by the [[First Order]].<ref name="TFA">{{Film|VII}}</ref> The desert sands north of the Kelvin Ravine were loose and crashed [[starship]]s could sink quickly. The remains of the [[Galactic Empire|Imperial]] [[Dreadnought-class heavy cruiser|''Dreadnought''-class heavy cruiser]] ''[[Explorator]]'' of [[Commodore]] [[Visler Aqorian Korda III]] lay there after it had crashed there during the [[Battle of Jakku]].<ref name="JoJ">''[[The Jaws of Jakku]]''</ref>

